t use H if D used. So must use G. So set {A, D, G}. Check: A covers 0,1; D covers 2,3; G covers 4. All elements covered exactly once. Valid.\n\nSubcase 1b: Use B ([2]) to cover 2. Then we need to cover 3 and 4. Options for 3: C ([3]) or H ([3,4]). For 4: G ([4]) or H ([3,4]).\n\nWe need to avoid duplicates.\n\nOption 1b-i: Use C ([3]) and G ([4]). Set {A, B, C, G}. Covers 0,1,2,3,4 exactly once. Valid"}}],"created":1790938975,"model":"C:\\Users\\d2j3\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-09-10\\napraw\\outputs\\moon-native\\models\\gpt-oss-20b-MXFP4.gguf","system_fingerprint":"b10809-5266f24da","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":768,"prompt_tokens":3787,"total_tokens":4555,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-QMe7185dO22dtuGmxZuiE3xzaid8pJhb","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":3787,"prompt_ms":497.737,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.13143306047002906,"prompt_per_second":7608.435780341826,"predicted_n":768,"predicted_ms":2493.446,"predicted_per_token_ms":3.250907431551499,"predicted_per_second":307.60642099327595}}